The project is built on the open-source [Yuxi](https://github.com/xerrors/Yuxi) agent framework. Upstream Yuxi contributors retain copyright and attribution for the general agent runtime, multi-tenant knowledge base, sandbox and middleware. See [LICENSE](LICENSE) for the full MIT notice and [README.md](README.md#license-and-acknowledgements) for the project acknowledgements.

Additional contributors are recorded in the repository history and on the GitHub contributors page.
